N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks).
N:Syllables placed on the notes as in the swaralipi (Sa = C); one swaralipi half-bar (3 matras) = one 3/4 bar.
N:Words follow the sung forms in the swaralipi (hri-doy-ga-hon, go-pon-baa-sir).
N:When "kaan pete roi" returns after each section, the MIDI leaves out "Aami".
